                       Buffers: shared hit\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e42\u003c/span\u003e\n                     \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e-\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e  Index Scan using segment_pkey \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003eon\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003epublic\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003esegment\u003c/span\u003e  (cost\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e43\u003c/span\u003e..\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e4\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e62\u003c/span\u003e rows\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e width\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e835\u003c/span\u003e) (actual \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003etime\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e003\u003c/span\u003e..\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e003\u003c/span\u003e rows\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e loops\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e413482\u003c/span\u003e)\n                           Output: \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003esegment\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003eid\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003esegment\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003eembedding\u003c/span\u003e\n                           Index Cond: (\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003esegment\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003eid\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003etaggeditem\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003eobject_id\u003c/span\u003e)\n                           Filter: (((\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003esegment\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003ecategory\u003c/span\u003e)::\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003etext\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e'\u003c/span\u003eShot\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e'\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e::\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003etext\u003c/span\u003e) \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003eAND\u003c/span\u003e ((\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003esegment\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003eembedding\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e\u0026lt;=\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e'\u003c/span\u003e[vector]\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e'\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e::halfvec) \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e'\u003c/span\u003e0.9\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e'\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e::\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003edouble precision\u003c/span\u003e))\n                           Rows Removed by Filter: \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\n                           Buffers: shared hit\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e1873169\u003c/span\u003e\n                           Worker \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e:  actual \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003etime\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e003\u003c/span\u003e..\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e003\u003c/span\u003e rows\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e loops\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e34006\u003c/span\u003e\n                             Buffers: shared hit\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e153353\u003c/span\u003e\n Query Identifier: \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e-\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e3296060046874035074\u003c/span\u003e\n Planning:\n   Buffers: shared hit\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e35\u003c/span\u003e\n Planning \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003eTime\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e294\u003c/span\u003e ms\n Execution \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003eTime\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e3420\u003c/span\u003e.\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e343\u003c/span\u003e ms\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://explain.dalibo.com/plan/0e569633acb4e5h5\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eQuery Plan Visualisation\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"auto\"\u003eWith \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eLIMIT 50\u003c/code\u003e, the vector index \u003cstrong\u003eis\u003c/strong\u003e used.\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003e\nClick to expand query plan\n\u003c/summary\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"Limit  (cost=2898.19..479096.12 rows=50 width=24) (actual time=3.194..64.412 rows=50 loops=1)\nOutput: segment.id, ((segment.embedding \u0026lt;=\u0026gt; '[vector]'::halfvec))\nBuffers: shared hit=34479\n-\u0026gt;  Nested Loop  (cost=2898.19..12212613.14 rows=1282 width=24) (actual time=3.193..64.399 rows=50 loops=1)\n      Output: segment.id, (segment.embedding \u0026lt;=\u0026gt; '[vector]'::halfvec)\n      Inner Unique: true\n      Buffers: shared hit=34479\n      -\u0026gt;  Nested Loop  (cost=2897.89..12082779.67 rows=4749735 width=851) (actual time=0.947..45.374 rows=30087 loops=1)\n            Output: segment.id, segment.embedding, taggeditem.tag_id\n            Buffers: shared hit=24850\n            -\u0026gt;  Index Scan using s_embedding_idx_shot on public.segment  (cost=2897.32..2187653.01 rows=198711 width=835) (actual time=0.927..19.427 rows=2649 loops=1)\n                  Output: segment.id, segment.embedding\n                  Order By: (segment.embedding \u0026lt;=\u0026gt; '[vector]'::halfvec)\n                  Filter: ((segment.embedding \u0026lt;=\u0026gt; '[vector]'::halfvec) \u0026lt; '0.9'::double precision)\n                  Buffers: shared hit=11165\n            -\u0026gt;  Index Scan using taggeditem_object_id_c44701f4 on public.taggeditem  (cost=0.57..42.69 rows=711 width=32) (actual time=0.005..0.007 rows=11 loops=2649)\n                  Output: taggeditem.created, taggeditem.modified, taggeditem.id, taggeditem.object_id, taggeditem.confidence, taggeditem.tag_type, taggeditem.content_type_id, taggeditem.owner_id, taggeditem.tag_id\n                  Index Cond: (taggeditem.object_id = segment.id)\n                  Buffers: shared hit=13685\n      -\u0026gt;  Memoize  (cost=0.30..4.41 rows=1 width=16) (actual time=0.000..0.000 rows=0 loops=30087)\n            Output: tag.id\n            Cache Key: taggeditem.tag_id\n            Cache Mode: logical\n            Hits: 26920  Misses: 3167  Evictions: 0  Overflows: 0  Memory Usage: 248kB\n            Buffers: shared hit=9501\n            -\u0026gt;  Index Scan using tag_pkey on public.tag  (cost=0.29..4.40 rows=1 width=16) (actual time=0.002..0.002 rows=0 loops=3167)\n                  Output: tag.id\n                  Index Cond: (tag.id = taggeditem.tag_id)\n                  Filter: (((tag.category)::text = 'Cinematography'::text) AND ((tag.name)::text = 'Wide Framing'::text))\n                  Rows Removed by Filter: 1\n                  Buffers: shared hit=9501\nQuery Identifier: -3296060046874035074\nPlanning:\nBuffers: shared hit=35\nPlanning Time: 3.325 ms\nExecution Time: 64.475 ms\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eLimit  (cost=2898.19..479096.12 rows=50 width=24) (actual time=3.194..64.412 rows=50 loops=1)\nOutput: segment.id, ((segment.embedding \u0026lt;=\u0026gt; '[vector]'::halfvec))\nBuffers: shared hit=34479\n-\u0026gt;  Nested Loop  (cost=2898.19..12212613.14 rows=1282 width=24) (actual time=3.193..64.399 rows=50 loops=1)\n      Output: segment.id, (segment.embedding \u0026lt;=\u0026gt; '[vector]'::halfvec)\n      Inner Unique: true\n      Buffers: shared hit=34479\n      -\u0026gt;  Nested Loop  (cost=2897.89..12082779.67 rows=4749735 width=851) (actual time=0.947..45.374 rows=30087 loops=1)\n            Output: segment.id, segment.embedding, taggeditem.tag_id\n            Buffers: shared hit=24850\n            -\u0026gt;  Index Scan using s_embedding_idx_shot on public.segment  (cost=2897.32..2187653.01 rows=198711 width=835) (actual time=0.927..19.427 rows=2649 loops=1)\n                  Output: segment.id, segment.embedding\n                  Order By: (segment.embedding \u0026lt;=\u0026gt; '[vector]'::halfvec)\n                  Filter: ((segment.embedding \u0026lt;=\u0026gt; '[vector]'::halfvec) \u0026lt; '0.9'::double precision)\n                  Buffers: shared hit=11165\n            -\u0026gt;  Index Scan using taggeditem_object_id_c44701f4 on public.taggeditem  (cost=0.57..42.69 rows=711 width=32) (actual time=0.005..0.007 rows=11 loops=2649)\n                  Output: taggeditem.created, taggeditem.modified, taggeditem.id, taggeditem.object_id, taggeditem.confidence, taggeditem.tag_type, taggeditem.content_type_id, taggeditem.owner_id, taggeditem.tag_id\n                  Index Cond: (taggeditem.object_id = segment.id)\n                  Buffers: shared hit=13685\n      -\u0026gt;  Memoize  (cost=0.30..4.41 rows=1 width=16) (actual time=0.000..0.000 rows=0 loops=30087)\n            Output: tag.id\n            Cache Key: taggeditem.tag_id\n            Cache Mode: logical\n            Hits: 26920  Misses: 3167  Evictions: 0  Overflows: 0  Memory Usage: 248kB\n            Buffers: shared hit=9501\n            -\u0026gt;  Index Scan using tag_pkey on public.tag  (cost=0.29..4.40 rows=1 width=16) (actual time=0.002..0.002 rows=0 loops=3167)\n                  Output: tag.id\n                  Index Cond: (tag.id = taggeditem.tag_id)\n                  Filter: (((tag.category)::text = 'Cinematography'::text) AND ((tag.name)::text = 'Wide Framing'::text))\n                  Rows Removed by Filter: 1\n                  Buffers: shared hit=9501\nQuery Identifier: -3296060046874035074\nPlanning:\nBuffers: shared hit=35\nPlanning Time: 3.325 ms\nExecution Time: 64.475 ms\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://explain.dalibo.com/plan/62dc4cc4623f35a5\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eQuery Plan Visualisation\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eSimilar to above, I've also noticed a similar pattern with different numbers when I change the values that I'm filtering by. Specifically, I changed \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003ecategory='AssetType'\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003ename='TV Ad'\u003c/code\u003e (stats on these below).\u003cbr\u003e\nWhen I change it to these values that are more frequently occuring in the \u003cem\u003etag\u003c/em\u003e table than the ones shown above, I see the exact same pattern, but with \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eLIMIT 20\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eLIMIT 10\u003c/code\u003e, where limiting to 10 results uses the vector index whereas 20 does not.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThis pattern makes me think if perhaps it's a memory issue?\u003cbr\u003e\nMy \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eshared_buffers\u003c/code\u003e is currently set to '4GB', which is 25% of the memory on the machine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eMy tables are not extremely large. Here are some stats that might be relevant:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003etag\u003c/em\u003e table size: 22,233\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003etaggeditem\u003c/em\u003e table size: 81,176,748\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003esegment\u003c/em\u003e table size: 3,969,216\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eno. of _taggeditem_s for (\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003ecategory\u003c/code\u003e='Cinematography' + \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003ename\u003c/code\u003e='Wide Framing') = 413,482\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eno. of _taggeditem_s for (\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003ecategory\u003c/code\u003e='AssetType' + \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003ename\u003c/code\u003e='TV Ad') = 3,124,493\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eIs this kind of behavior expected? I expect the tables to grow to billions of rows, and would appreciate any insight into how to mitigate this and make the same query consistently use the index regardless of the values one's filtering by.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"1203f022bca7210b647255bd3ace44f9ffe9d3b5236764b5c13f05094ac9799c","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":2,"nodes":[{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4OTk0OQ==","login":"ethagnawl","name":"Pete Doherty","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289949?s=64\u0026u=ff5ea7db732e80692d39c2ec42954cfe620fe8b6\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User"},{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTk0NTk=","login":"itsubaki","name":null,"avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1759459?s=64\u0026u=39363bb6a79a150234632f034997a2cc2d27e8ba\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User"}]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":3,"nodes":[{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDEx","login":"vade","name":"Anton Marini","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65011?s=64\u0026u=6d48ca7fca1110c2b25482d101186d00cce599fe\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User"},{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NDM2Ng==","login":"damian0815","name":"Damian","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144366?s=64\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User"},{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTk0NTk=","login":"itsubaki","name":null,"avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1759459?s=64\u0026u=39363bb6a79a150234632f034997a2cc2d27e8ba\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User"}]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}}],"pinnedIssueComment":null,"__isIssueOrPullRequest":"Issue","isPinned":false,"viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanTransfer":false,"viewerCanConvertToDiscussion":false,"viewerCanLock":false,"timelineItems":{"totalCount":5,"beforeFocusCount":0,"afterFocusCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"hasPreviousPage":false,"startCursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABk5LZRcgAqjI1MTgxNzIyMDI=","endCursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABlUkU3TgAqjI2ODkwMzU5OTg="},"edges":[{"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABk5LZRcgAqjI1MTgxNzIyMDI=","node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOFXRw2c6WGEIq","databaseId":2518172202,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"id":"I_kwDOFXRw2c6hBQ7k","author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTExNDc0","login":"rsomani95"},"number":721,"locked":false,"databaseId":2701463268},"author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDM1OA==","login":"ankane","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220358?u=ba13f3240d7992dc4124a33a4fc65bf4924e5375\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/ankane","name":"Andrew Kane"},"url":"https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector/issues/721#issuecomment-2518172202","createdAt":"2024-12-04T18:05:33Z","authorAssociation":"MEMBER","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"isHidden":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":"2024-12-04T18:09:15Z","lastUserContentEdit":{"id":"UCE_lALOFXRw2c6WGEIqzlbMEA0","editor":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDM1OA==","url":"https://github.com/ankane","login":"ankane"}},"pinnedBy":null,"body":"Hi @rsomani95, scanning more a vector index will be more expensive (which can happen with a higher limit or filters with a lower selectivity), and it looks like that's pushing it over the cost of other index scans. If you haven't already, try setting `random_page_cost` to 1.1. You can also use the [pg_hint_plan extension](https://github.com/ossc-db/pg_hint_plan) to better control if an index is used.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/rsomani95/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/rsomani95\"\u003e@rsomani95\u003c/a\u003e, scanning more a vector index will be more expensive (which can happen with a higher limit or filters with a lower selectivity), and it looks like that's pushing it over the cost of other index scans. If you haven't already, try setting \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003erandom_page_cost\u003c/code\u003e to 1.1. You can also use the \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/ossc-db/pg_hint_plan\"\u003epg_hint_plan extension\u003c/a\u003e to better control if an index is used.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"a55999118f3b16f82a58b0068b829dae59f008ff8e1e3267ce5fabbb4c99b41b","viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzNTk5NTI2MDE=","name":"pgvector","owner":{"__typename":"Organization","id":"O_kgDOBdznXg","login":"pgvector","url":"https://github.com/pgvector"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"pgvector/pgvector","databaseId":359952601},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}}]}},{"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABk5Lf8NAAqjI1MTgxODgzNjI=","node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOFXRw2c6WGIFK","databaseId":2518188362,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"id":"I_kwDOFXRw2c6hBQ7k","author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTExNDc0","login":"rsomani95"},"number":721,"locked":false,"databaseId":2701463268},"author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTExNDc0","login":"rsomani95","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17111474?u=c9f77b858841bc7871ed67e25d095d2688b760dd\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/rsomani95","name":"Rahul Somani"},"url":"https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector/issues/721#issuecomment-2518188362","createdAt":"2024-12-04T18:12:50Z","authorAssociation":"NONE","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"isHidden":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"@ankane thanks. I had tried `random_page_cost=1.1` but that didn't help either. \r\nI forgot to mention but I'd also set `enable_seqscan=off` globally when trying this.\r\n\r\nthe hint plan looks worth a shot - I'll try it out and report back if it helps.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/ankane/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/ankane\"\u003e@ankane\u003c/a\u003e thanks. I had tried \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003erandom_page_cost=1.1\u003c/code\u003e but that didn't help either.\u003cbr\u003e\nI forgot to mention but I'd also set \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eenable_seqscan=off\u003c/code\u003e globally when trying this.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003ethe hint plan looks worth a shot - I'll try it out and report back if it helps.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"1d33557b3faf1e925ba52b10bdbc0d2191d21470002800f322b5f0d016f60c42","viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzNTk5NTI2MDE=","name":"pgvector","owner":{"__typename":"Organization","id":"O_kgDOBdznXg","login":"pgvector","url":"https://github.com/pgvector"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"pgvector/pgvector","databaseId":359952601},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":1,"nodes":[{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMDA4ODM5","login":"green-0-rabbit","name":null,"avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80008839?s=64\u0026u=12cd3554783bdb892c5952f688be807f754cf147\u0026v=4"}]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}}]}},{"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABlQHrgLAAqjI2NTgwMTAyMDE=","node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOFXRw2c6ebgRZ","databaseId":2658010201,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"id":"I_kwDOFXRw2c6hBQ7k","author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTExNDc0","login":"rsomani95"},"number":721,"locked":false,"databaseId":2701463268},"author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDM1OA==","login":"ankane","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220358?u=ba13f3240d7992dc4124a33a4fc65bf4924e5375\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/ankane","name":"Andrew Kane"},"url":"https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector/issues/721#issuecomment-2658010201","createdAt":"2025-02-14T00:46:06Z","authorAssociation":"MEMBER","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"isHidden":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"I'm not sure there's anything for pgvector to do here, so closing this out.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eI'm not sure there's anything for pgvector to do here, so closing this out.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"51a5abfc40e06f31836a07e160c394b353797b59d53622eeba8b134266f17d84","viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzNTk5NTI2MDE=","name":"pgvector","owner":{"__typename":"Organization","id":"O_kgDOBdznXg","login":"pgvector","url":"https://github.com/pgvector"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"pgvector/pgvector","databaseId":359952601},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}}]}},{"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABlQHrgLABqzE2MzA0NDcwMjU1","node":{"__typename":"ClosedEvent","id":"CE_lADOFXRw2c6hBQ7kzwAAAAPL0njv","databaseId":16304470255,"createdAt":"2025-02-14T00:46:06Z","actor":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDM1OA==","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220358?s=64\u0026u=ba13f3240d7992dc4124a33a4fc65bf4924e5375\u0026v=4","login":"ankane","profileResourcePath":"/ankane","__typename":"User","name":"Andrew Kane"},"stateReason":"COMPLETED","duplicateOf":null,"closingProjectItemStatus":null,"closer":null,"intent":null}},{"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABlUkU3TgAqjI2ODkwMzU5OTg=","node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOFXRw2c6gR27e","databaseId":2689035998,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"id":"I_kwDOFXRw2c6hBQ7k","author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTExNDc0","login":"rsomani95"},"number":721,"locked":false,"databaseId":2701463268},"author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTExNDc0","login":"rsomani95","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17111474?u=c9f77b858841bc7871ed67e25d095d2688b760dd\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/rsomani95","name":"Rahul Somani"},"url":"https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector/issues/721#issuecomment-2689035998","createdAt":"2025-02-27T20:24:19Z","authorAssociation":"NONE","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"isHidden":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"The `pg_hint_plan` suggestion sent me down a bit of a rabbit hole. While it did force postgres to use the index, the quality of the results was quite inferior to brute force search (which was almost never the case when postgres decided to use the index by itself). I figured that part of the problem was that my filtering params were shaving off like 90% of the graph (not an exact number, but you get the point), so there really wasn't much space left to traverse within the HNSW graph. I ended up building a more tightly scoped index with some of the filtering params built in. ","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThe \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003epg_hint_plan\u003c/code\u003e suggestion sent me down a bit of a rabbit hole. While it did force postgres to use the index, the quality of the results was quite inferior to brute force search (which was almost never the case when postgres decided to use the index by itself). I figured that part of the problem was that my filtering params were shaving off like 90% of the graph (not an exact number, but you get the point), so there really wasn't much space left to traverse within the HNSW graph. I ended up building a more tightly scoped index with some of the filtering params built in.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"9037d835d4de57ddf95bf70bb278f166c4ad4f463afbfc8c13c602a30421ae4d","viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzNTk5NTI2MDE=","name":"pgvector","owner":{"__typename":"Organization","id":"O_kgDOBdznXg","login":"pgvector","url":"https://github.com/pgvector"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"pgvector/pgvector","databaseId":359952601},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}}]}}]},"backTimelineItems":{"totalCount":5,"beforeFocusCount":0,"afterFocusCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"hasPreviousPage":false,"startCursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABk5LZRcgAqjI1MTgxNzIyMDI=","endCursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABlUkU3TgAqjI2ODkwMzU5OTg="},"edges":[{"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABk5LZRcgAqjI1MTgxNzIyMDI=","node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOFXRw2c6WGEIq","databaseId":2518172202,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"id":"I_kwDOFXRw2c6hBQ7k","author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTExNDc0","login":"rsomani95"},"number":721,"locked":false,"databaseId":2701463268},"author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDM1OA==","login":"ankane","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220358?u=ba13f3240d7992dc4124a33a4fc65bf4924e5375\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/ankane","name":"Andrew Kane"},"url":"https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector/issues/721#issuecomment-2518172202","createdAt":"2024-12-04T18:05:33Z","authorAssociation":"MEMBER","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"isHidden":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":"2024-12-04T18:09:15Z","lastUserContentEdit":{"id":"UCE_lALOFXRw2c6WGEIqzlbMEA0","editor":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDM1OA==","url":"https://github.com/ankane","login":"ankane"}},"pinnedBy":null,"body":"Hi @rsomani95, scanning more a vector index will be more expensive (which can happen with a higher limit or filters with a lower selectivity), and it looks like that's pushing it over the cost of other index scans. If you haven't already, try setting `random_page_cost` to 1.1. You can also use the [pg_hint_plan extension](https://github.com/ossc-db/pg_hint_plan) to better control if an index is used.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/rsomani95/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/rsomani95\"\u003e@rsomani95\u003c/a\u003e, scanning more a vector index will be more expensive (which can happen with a higher limit or filters with a lower selectivity), and it looks like that's pushing it over the cost of other index scans. If you haven't already, try setting \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003erandom_page_cost\u003c/code\u003e to 1.1. You can also use the \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/ossc-db/pg_hint_plan\"\u003epg_hint_plan extension\u003c/a\u003e to better control if an index is used.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"a55999118f3b16f82a58b0068b829dae59f008ff8e1e3267ce5fabbb4c99b41b","viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzNTk5NTI2MDE=","name":"pgvector","owner":{"__typename":"Organization","id":"O_kgDOBdznXg","login":"pgvector","url":"https://github.com/pgvector"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"pgvector/pgvector","databaseId":359952601},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}}]}},{"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABk5Lf8NAAqjI1MTgxODgzNjI=","node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOFXRw2c6WGIFK","databaseId":2518188362,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"id":"I_kwDOFXRw2c6hBQ7k","author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTExNDc0","login":"rsomani95"},"number":721,"locked":false,"databaseId":2701463268},"author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTExNDc0","login":"rsomani95","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17111474?u=c9f77b858841bc7871ed67e25d095d2688b760dd\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/rsomani95","name":"Rahul Somani"},"url":"https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector/issues/721#issuecomment-2518188362","createdAt":"2024-12-04T18:12:50Z","authorAssociation":"NONE","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"isHidden":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"@ankane thanks. I had tried `random_page_cost=1.1` but that didn't help either. \r\nI forgot to mention but I'd also set `enable_seqscan=off` globally when trying this.\r\n\r\nthe hint plan looks worth a shot - I'll try it out and report back if it helps.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/ankane/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/ankane\"\u003e@ankane\u003c/a\u003e thanks. I had tried \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003erandom_page_cost=1.1\u003c/code\u003e but that didn't help either.\u003cbr\u003e\nI forgot to mention but I'd also set \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eenable_seqscan=off\u003c/code\u003e globally when trying this.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003ethe hint plan looks worth a shot - I'll try it out and report back if it helps.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"1d33557b3faf1e925ba52b10bdbc0d2191d21470002800f322b5f0d016f60c42","viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzNTk5NTI2MDE=","name":"pgvector","owner":{"__typename":"Organization","id":"O_kgDOBdznXg","login":"pgvector","url":"https://github.com/pgvector"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"pgvector/pgvector","databaseId":359952601},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":1,"nodes":[{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMDA4ODM5","login":"green-0-rabbit","name":null,"avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80008839?s=64\u0026u=12cd3554783bdb892c5952f688be807f754cf147\u0026v=4"}]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}}]}},{"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABlQHrgLAAqjI2NTgwMTAyMDE=","node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOFXRw2c6ebgRZ","databaseId":2658010201,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"id":"I_kwDOFXRw2c6hBQ7k","author":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTExNDc0","login":"rsomani95"},"number":72