sContainer__ZaEPJ0"><button data-component="IconButton" type="button" aria-label="Actions for ankane&#x27;s comment, 6:05 PM on December 4, 2024" data-testid="comment-header-hamburger" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk CommentActionsIconButton__rdmp8b prc-Button-IconButton-fyge7" data-loading="false" data-no-visuals="true" data-size="small" data-variant="invisible" aria-describedby="_R_1ud8q7teutkp85_" id="_R_2d8q7teutkp85_"><svg data-component="Octicon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="octicon octicon-kebab-horizontal" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" display="inline-block" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:text-bottom"><path d="M8 9a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3ZM1.5 9a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3Zm13 0a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3Z"></path></svg></button><span class="prc-TooltipV2-Tooltip-tLeuB" data-direction="n" data-component="Tooltip" role="tooltip" aria-hidden="true" id="_R_1ud8q7teutkp85_">More actions</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="IssueCommentBody__DGWd7U"><div data-testid="markdown-body" data-team-hovercards-enabled="true" class="markdown-body" data-turbolinks="false"><div class="markdown-body safe-html-box__Uwc6Al"><p dir="auto">Hi <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/rsomani95/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/rsomani95">@rsomani95</a>, scanning more a vector index will be more expensive (which can happen with a higher limit or filters with a lower selectivity), and it looks like that's pushing it over the cost of other index scans. If you haven't already, try setting <code class="notranslate">random_page_cost</code> to 1.1. You can also use the <a href="https://github.com/ossc-db/pg_hint_plan">pg_hint_plan extension</a> to better control if an index is used.</p></div></div><div role="toolbar" aria-label="Reactions" class="d-flex gap-1 flex-wrap"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li data-wrapper-timeline-id="IC_kwDOFXRw2c6WGIFK"><div class="timelineElement__l_1Q03 nonLeadingElement_inlineAvatars__g_btmU"><div class="Box__9aTioE"><div data-testid="timeline-divider-IC_kwDOFXRw2c6WGIFK" class="Box__swapE6 Box_inlineAvatars__OXEjSV"><div data-testid="timeline-divider-connector" class="Box_1__gSBsk4"></div><div class="Box_2__t0-6Om"></div></div><div data-timeline-event-id="IC_kwDOFXRw2c6WGIFK" data-highlighted-event="false" class="shared__KSUE2D major__A5_AyP" data-testid="timeline-row-border-IC_kwDOFXRw2c6WGIFK"><div class="react-issue-comment IssueCommentLayout__fNsTnn"><div data-testid="comment-viewer-outer-box-IC_kwDOFXRw2c6WGIFK" class="IssueCommentContent__ViXx9n"><div id="issuecomment-2518188362" data-testid="comment-header" class="ActivityHeaderContainer__sf0_ID containerBase__VGAID6 containerForceInlineAvatarPadding__S4YfhL"><div class="activityHeader__V45NcJ ActivityHeaderGridLayout__Ip6-X-"><h3 class="sr-only">rsomani95<!-- --> <!-- -->commented<!-- --> <relative-time data-component="RelativeTime">on<!-- --> <!-- -->Dec 4, 2024<!-- --> </relative-time></h3><div class="AvatarContainer__ybjZo9"><a class="avatarLink__sqWzwe prc-Link-Link-9ZwDx" data-component="Link" href="/rsomani95" aria-label="@rsomani95&#x27;s profile"><img data-component="Avatar" class="activityAvatar__jAnd8Q prc-Avatar-Avatar-0xaUi" alt="@rsomani95" width="24" height="24" style="--avatarSize-regular:24px" src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17111474?u=c9f77b858841bc7871ed67e25d095d2688b760dd&amp;v=4&amp;size=48" data-testid="github-avatar"/></a></div><div class="narrowViewportWrapper__C5cNkS CommentHeaderContentContainer__qvr9Sa" data-testid="comment-header-left-side-items"><div class="TitleContainer__9rC_Bh"><a class="AuthorName__V4JPE4 AuthorLink__aW5AQQ color-fg-default prc-Link-Link-9ZwDx" data-component="Link" href="/rsomani95" data-testid="a