CommentBody__DGWd7U"><div data-testid="markdown-body" data-team-hovercards-enabled="true" class="markdown-body" data-turbolinks="false"><div class="markdown-body safe-html-box__Uwc6Al"><p dir="auto"><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/ankane/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/ankane">@ankane</a> thanks. I had tried <code class="notranslate">random_page_cost=1.1</code> but that didn't help either.<br>
I forgot to mention but I'd also set <code class="notranslate">enable_seqscan=off</code> globally when trying this.</p>
<p dir="auto">the hint plan looks worth a shot - I'll try it out and report back if it helps.</p></div></div><div role="toolbar" aria-label="Reactions" class="d-flex gap-1 flex-wrap"><div class="ReactionPopoverAnchor__B84pko"><button data-component="Button" type="button" aria-label="👍 1 reaction" role="switch" aria-checked="false" class="prc-Button-ButtonBase-9n-Xk reactionToggleButton__j2dnln" data-inactive="true" data-loading="false" data-size="small" data-variant="default" aria-describedby="_R_3dabteutkp85_ _R_3dabteutkp85H2_"><span data-component="buttonContent" data-align="center" class="prc-Button-ButtonContent-Iohp5"><span data-component="leadingVisual" class="prc-Button-Visual-YNt2F prc-Button-LeadingVisual-UySKu prc-Button-VisualWrap-E4cnq">👍</span><span data-component="text" class="prc-Button-Label-FWkx3"><span class="sr-only" id="_R_3dabteutkp85_">React with 👍</span>1</span></span></button><span class="sr-only" id="_R_3dabteutkp85H2_">Reacted by <!-- -->green-0-rabbit</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li data-wrapper-timeline-id="IC_kwDOFXRw2c6ebgRZ"><div class="timelineElement__l_1Q03 nonLeadingElement_inlineAvatars__g_btmU"><div class="Box__9aTioE"><div data-testid="timeline-divider-IC_kwDOFXRw2c6ebgRZ" class="Box__swapE6 Box_inlineAvatars__OXEjSV"><div data-testid="timeline-divider-connector" class="Box_1__gSBsk4"></div><div class="Box_2__t0-6Om"></div></div><div data-timeline-event-id="IC_kwDOFXRw2c6ebgRZ" data-highlighted-event="false" class="shared__KSUE2D major__A5_AyP" data-testid="timeline-row-border-IC_kwDOFXRw2c6ebgRZ"><div class="react-issue-comment IssueCommentLayout__fNsTnn"><div data-testid="comment-viewer-outer-box-IC_kwDOFXRw2c6ebgRZ" class="IssueCommentContent__ViXx9n"><div id="issuecomment-2658010201" data-testid="comment-header" class="ActivityHeaderContainer__sf0_ID containerBase__VGAID6 containerForceInlineAvatarPadding__S4YfhL"><div class="activityHeader__V45NcJ ActivityHeaderGridLayout__Ip6-X-"><h3 class="